    <string name="header">Tap a category below to view and change its settings.</string>
    <string name="header_note" formatted="false">Wired network: turn the adapter on/off and choose DHCP or a static IP. Audio output: switch between the connected speaker / headphones / HDMI / Bluetooth. Bypass charging stops charging at 80% and resumes below 80%. Double-tap to wake only applies while a charger is connected. Choosing \u201cDefault\u201d leaves a key untouched.</string>

