    <string name="hdmi_note" formatted="false">Fill mirror makes the internal screen render at the external display\u2019s aspect, so the external picture stays full-screen and undistorted (the internal screen shows small letterbox bars). Apps that open their own Presentation can still drive the two screens independently. After stopping the output, re-plugging HDMI restores it automatically.</string>

